function normalizeTmdbTitle(value){var ignored=' ·・:：,，.。!！?？“”‘’《》()（）-_/';return String(value||'').toLowerCase().split('').filter(function(c){return ignored.indexOf(c)===-1}).join('')}
function pickTmdbHit(name,results){var candidates=Array.isArray(results)?results:[],expectedId=fixedTmdbIds[name];if(expectedId){var knownHit=candidates.find(function(x){return Number(x.id)===expectedId});return knownHit||{id:expectedId,poster_path:''}}var query=normalizeTmdbTitle(name),ranked=candidates.map(function(hit,index){var title=normalizeTmdbTitle(hit.name||hit.title),originalTitle=normalizeTmdbTitle(hit.original_name||hit.original_title),genres=hit.genre_ids||[],countries=hit.origin_country||[];var score=0;if(title===query||originalTitle===query)score+=100;else if(title.indexOf(query)>-1||query.indexOf(title)>-1||originalTitle.indexOf(query)>-1||query.indexOf(originalTitle)>-1)score+=35;if(genres.indexOf(16)>-1)score+=60;if(hit.original_language==='zh')score+=15;if(countries.indexOf('CN')>-1)score+=10;score+=Math.min(Number(hit.popularity)||0,100)/100;return{hit:hit,score:score,index:index}}).sort(function(a,b){return b.score-a.score||a.index-b.index});return ranked.length?ranked[0].hit:null}
async function fetchPlatform(name,id){var out=[];try{var d=await tmdbSearch(name,id);var det=d&&d.results&&d.results[0];var nets=det&&det.networks;if(nets&&nets.length){out=nets.map(function(n){return{name:n.name||'',logo:n.logo_path?'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w92'+n.logo_path:''}})}}catch(error){console.warn('平台获取失败',error)}return out}
